[
  {
    "beat": "S01",
    "start": 0.1,
    "end": 2.445,
    "text": "Hi, I am Dhrumil Shah, and this video is"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S01",
    "start": 2.445,
    "end": 4.556,
    "text": "about Mycroft Phase 4, where I added"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S01",
    "start": 4.556,
    "end": 6.901,
    "text": "market-regime discovery and regime-aware"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S01",
    "start": 6.901,
    "end": 9.364,
    "text": "thresholds so the system reports where its"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S01",
    "start": 9.364,
    "end": 11.65,
    "text": "forecasts hold up, instead of one score"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S01",
    "start": 11.65,
    "end": 13.147,
    "text": "for every market."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S02",
    "start": 13.147,
    "end": 15.696,
    "text": "Phase 3 ended with an honest result."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S02",
    "start": 15.696,
    "end": 17.155,
    "text": "Across a hundred and twenty"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S02",
    "start": 17.155,
    "end": 18.885,
    "text": "tickers, five-day direction came"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S02",
    "start": 18.885,
    "end": 20.436,
    "text": "out close to a coin flip."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S02",
    "start": 20.436,
    "end": 23.064,
    "text": "One number, for every market condition."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S03",
    "start": 23.064,
    "end": 25.148,
    "text": "That single number hides something."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S03",
    "start": 25.148,
    "end": 26.868,
    "text": "A calm market and a crash are"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S03",
    "start": 26.868,
    "end": 28.314,
    "text": "not the same problem."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S03",
    "start": 28.314,
    "end": 30.126,
    "text": "Phase 4 asks whether the model's"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S03",
    "start": 30.126,
    "end": 31.994,
    "text": "weakness depends on the regime it"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S03",
    "start": 31.994,
    "end": 33.457,
    "text": "is predicting in."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S04",
    "start": 33.457,
    "end": 35.394,
    "text": "The input is unchanged."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S04",
    "start": 35.394,
    "end": 37.377,
    "text": "One hundred and eighty-four thousand"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S04",
    "start": 37.377,
    "end": 39.416,
    "text": "rows, one hundred and twenty tickers,"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S04",
    "start": 39.416,
    "end": 42.426,
    "text": "January twenty-twenty to February twenty-twenty-six."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S04",
    "start": 42.426,
    "end": 44.61,
    "text": "Same data, new question."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S05",
    "start": 44.61,
    "end": 46.583,
    "text": "The pipeline gains a layer."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S05",
    "start": 46.583,
    "end": 48.859,
    "text": "Daily prices become a market table; the"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S05",
    "start": 48.859,
    "end": 51.193,
    "text": "market table becomes regimes; the regime"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S05",
    "start": 51.193,
    "end": 53.469,
    "text": "label joins the features; and the model"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S05",
    "start": 53.469,
    "end": 57.004,
    "text": "learns a separate decision threshold for each regime."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S06",
    "start": 57.004,
    "end": 58.717,
    "text": "First, I collapse every ticker"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S06",
    "start": 58.717,
    "end": 60.116,
    "text": "into one row per day."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S06",
    "start": 60.116,
    "end": 62.639,
    "text": "Market return, cross-sectional volatility,"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S06",
    "start": 62.639,
    "end": 65.042,
    "text": "median twenty-day return and volatility,"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S06",
    "start": 65.042,
    "end": 67.205,
    "text": "advance rate, and rolling twenty-day"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S06",
    "start": 67.205,
    "end": 68.847,
    "text": "volatility and momentum."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S06",
    "start": 68.847,
    "end": 70.374,
    "text": "Seven numbers that describe"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S06",
    "start": 70.374,
    "end": 71.834,
    "text": "the whole market."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S07",
    "start": 71.834,
    "end": 73.837,
    "text": "Then K-means splits those days"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S07",
    "start": 73.837,
    "end": 75.239,
    "text": "into four regimes."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S07",
    "start": 75.239,
    "end": 77.46,
    "text": "The clustering is fit only on the training"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S07",
    "start": 77.46,
    "end": 79.417,
    "text": "dates and then applied forward, so no"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S07",
    "start": 79.417,
    "end": 81.256,
    "text": "future day shapes the clusters."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S07",
    "start": 81.256,
    "end": 82.892,
    "text": "Each cluster gets a readable"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S07",
    "start": 82.892,
    "end": 84.735,
    "text": "name from its centroid."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S08",
    "start": 84.735,
    "end": 85.816,
    "text": "Here is the map."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S08",
    "start": 85.816,
    "end": 87.629,
    "text": "Stressed bear is almost entirely"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S08",
    "start": 87.629,
    "end": 90.492,
    "text": "the early twenty-twenty crash, twenty-four days."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S08",
    "start": 90.492,
    "end": 92.816,
    "text": "High volatility, ninety-seven."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S08",
    "start": 92.816,
    "end": 94.681,
    "text": "The market spends most of its life"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S08",
    "start": 94.681,
    "end": 96.162,
    "text": "in calm bull, eight hundred"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S08",
    "start": 96.162,
    "end": 98.082,
    "text": "twenty-one days, or sideways mixed,"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S08",
    "start": 98.082,
    "end": 99.898,
    "text": "five hundred fifty-four."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S09",
    "start": 99.898,
    "end": 102.51,
    "text": "The model is an Extra Trees classifier over"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S09",
    "start": 102.51,
    "end": 105.182,
    "text": "nineteen price and volume features, plus the"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S09",
    "start": 105.182,
    "end": 106.901,
    "text": "regime identifier itself."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S09",
    "start": 106.901,
    "end": 109.087,
    "text": "Train, validation and test are split by"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S09",
    "start": 109.087,
    "end": 111.328,
    "text": "date, and missing values are filled with"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S09",
    "start": 111.328,
    "end": 113.061,
    "text": "training medians only."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S10",
    "start": 113.061,
    "end": 114.907,
    "text": "The headline is still honest."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S10",
    "start": 114.907,
    "end": 117.243,
    "text": "Test ROC-AUC is point five one eight,"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S10",
    "start": 117.243,
    "end": 119.642,
    "text": "and the Brier score is point two five,"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S10",
    "start": 119.642,
    "end": 121.546,
    "text": "what a coin flip gives you."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S10",
    "start": 121.546,
    "end": 123.228,
    "text": "Regime awareness did not make"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S10",
    "start": 123.228,
    "end": 124.946,
    "text": "the model predictive."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 124.946,
    "end": 126.355,
    "text": "But split it by regime and"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 126.355,
    "end": 127.585,
    "text": "something shows up."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 127.585,
    "end": 129.434,
    "text": "In high volatility, AUC is"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 129.434,
    "end": 130.772,
    "text": "point five four."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 130.772,
    "end": 133.018,
    "text": "Sideways mixed, point five two."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 133.018,
    "end": 135.522,
    "text": "In calm bull, the most common regime, it is"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 135.522,
    "end": 137.469,
    "text": "point four nine, below chance."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 137.469,
    "end": 139.377,
    "text": "The model is least useful exactly"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S11",
    "start": 139.377,
    "end": 141.323,
    "text": "when the market is quiet."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S12",
    "start": 141.323,
    "end": 143.603,
    "text": "Permutation importance agrees."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S12",
    "start": 143.603,
    "end": 145.343,
    "text": "The regime identifier is the"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S12",
    "start": 145.343,
    "end": 147.393,
    "text": "single most useful feature, by an"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S12",
    "start": 147.393,
    "end": 148.774,
    "text": "order of magnitude."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S12",
    "start": 148.774,
    "end": 150.78,
    "text": "Most technical indicators contribute"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S12",
    "start": 150.78,
    "end": 152.729,
    "text": "nothing, or slightly hurt."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S13",
    "start": 152.729,
    "end": 154.449,
    "text": "So the thresholds adapt."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S13",
    "start": 154.449,
    "end": 156.837,
    "text": "Each regime gets its own cut-off, tuned on"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S13",
    "start": 156.837,
    "end": 159.224,
    "text": "validation for balanced accuracy, and only"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S13",
    "start": 159.224,
    "end": 161.555,
    "text": "names that clear it by eight points enter"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S13",
    "start": 161.555,
    "end": 162.835,
    "text": "the research queue."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S13",
    "start": 162.835,
    "end": 164.487,
    "text": "On the latest day, a calm bull"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S13",
    "start": 164.487,
    "end": 166.363,
    "text": "day, two names qualified."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 166.363,
    "end": 167.891,
    "text": "Phase 4's accomplishment is"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 167.891,
    "end": 169.166,
    "text": "not a better score."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 169.166,
    "end": 170.911,
    "text": "It is a system that knows where"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 170.911,
    "end": 172.406,
    "text": "it is weak and says so."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 172.406,
    "end": 174.278,
    "text": "Next: more history behind the rare"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 174.278,
    "end": 176.094,
    "text": "regimes, calibration measured per"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 176.094,
    "end": 177.966,
    "text": "regime, and a stressed-bear sample"
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 177.966,
    "end": 179.817,
    "text": "large enough to actually test."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 179.817,
    "end": 181.265,
    "text": "I'm Dhrumil Shah."
  },
  {
    "beat": "S14",
    "start": 181.265,
    "end": 182.512,
    "text": "Thank you for watching."
  }
]